        "Biomedical image segmentation - the original application and still the dominant one: cell/nucleus segmentation, organ and tumor delineation in CT/MRI, retinal vessel extraction. nnU-Net (a self-configuring U-Net pipeline) remains a top performer across dozens of medical benchmarks, which is a strong statement about the architecture's durability.",
        "Diffusion model denoisers: DDPM, Stable Diffusion, and their descendants use a U-Net (with attention blocks inserted at low resolutions and timestep conditioning) as the network that predicts noise - identical shape requirement, image in and image out with global context plus local detail.",
