          "caption": "The honest benchmark: an ~8.5x FLOP reduction typically buys only ~2-3x real latency, because depthwise convolutions are memory-bandwidth-bound (low arithmetic intensity). Always benchmark on the TARGET device - FLOPs are a proxy, not the objective."
